=begin

  Starts alsohere_sagapanel. Keep this name so ;alsohere and autostart
  still work.

  Usage:
    ;alsohere              - Start the Also Here Saga panel
    ;alsohere_sagapanel    - Same, run the panel directly

       creator: loraque (loraque@gmail.com)
        author: loraque (loraque@gmail.com)
          game: Gemstone
          tags: saga, frontend, panel, room, pcs
      required: Lich >= 5.12.0
       version: 0.2.0

  changelog:
    0.2.0 (2026-09-11)
      launcher for alsohere_sagapanel (replaces story-window Thread/get)
    0.1.0
      story-window entry occupancy tracker

=end

if Script.running?("alsohere_sagapanel")
  echo "alsohere: panel already running (;alsohere_sagapanel)"
else
  Script.start("alsohere_sagapanel")
end
